{%- comment -%}
  Mirrors ../design-system/src/react/Card/Card.module.css's .description (:66-71): the product's own
  description, one step quieter than the title and price above it.

  This block exists because Horizon has no product-bound description block. blocks/text.liquid takes
  static merchant copy and never binds to the surrounding product, and blocks/custom-liquid.liquid
  would render unstyled, spending none of the design system's text-role vocabulary.

  Reads closest.product, so it renders only inside a product context -- a native product card, the
  card slot of sections/mionas-collection.liquid, or a product page. Anywhere else, nothing.

  WHY IT RENDERS NOTHING FOR A PRODUCT WITH NO DESCRIPTION:
  an empty element would still contribute the card's flex `gap`, opening a hole between the price and
  the button on exactly the products that have least to say. The blank check below is on the STRIPPED
  text, not on product.description, because a description containing only markup (an empty <p>, say)
  is non-blank before strip_html and blank after.

  WHY THE TEXT IS TRUNCATED AS WELL AS CLAMPED:
  the clamp in the stylesheet is visual only -- the full string still ships in the HTML. A collection
  page renders 24 of these, so without truncatewords the page carries 24 complete product
  descriptions to display two lines of each. 30 words also puts a real ellipsis on the fallback path,
  where -webkit-line-clamp is unsupported and the clamp silently does nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product = closest.product
  assign description = product.description | strip_html | truncatewords: 30
-%}

{%- if product != blank and description != blank -%}
  {%- render 'mionas-text',
    content: description,
    role: block.settings.role,
    variant: 'default',
    tag: 'p',
    class: 'mionas-product-description',
    shopify_attributes: block.shopify_attributes
  -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* The role owns size, line-height, letter-spacing and family via snippets/mionas-text.liquid.
     Four things are left here.

     The edge inset, because ProductCard carries no padding of its own -- each subcomponent sets its
     own. Note this is no longer a shared convention: blocks/mionas-price.liquid and
     blocks/mionas-add-to-cart.liquid both dropped their built-in inset for four padding range
     settings rendered through snippets/spacing-style.liquid, so this block is now the only one in the
     card that hardcodes it. Keeping it was a deliberate no-op, not an oversight -- nobody has asked
     for the description's padding to be merchant-editable. Move it to settings the same way if that
     changes; the ids and mechanism are in mionas-add-to-cart.liquid.

     The weight and THE COLOUR, both from the design system's CardDescription tokens
     (Card.module.css:66-71, weight at :69, colour at :70). Note the colour override is the opposite
     call from the one mionas-price makes. It deliberately does NOT override colour,
     because --product-card-price-foreground resolves to the same
     #101413 that .text-role--default already applies, so overriding would only have made its
     Color setting dead. --card-description-foreground is #687076 (design-tokens.css:238) -- a
     genuinely different value -- so it has to be spent here. THAT IS WHY THIS BLOCK SHIPS NO Color
     SETTING: one that this rule then overrode would be a control that does nothing.

     And the clamp. -webkit-line-clamp needs all three of display, box-orient and overflow to take
     effect; where it is unsupported the text simply runs to its truncatewords limit, which is why
     the Liquid truncates as well.

     THE SELECTOR IS TWO CLASSES DEEP ON PURPOSE: every .text-role--<role> declares font-weight from
     a single-class selector in this same compiled stylesheet, so equal specificity would leave the
     winner to bundle order. .text-role.mionas-product-description is (0,2,0). Do not flatten it. */
  .text-role.mionas-product-description {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-inline: var(--product-card-base-padding-inline);
    font-weight: var(--card-description-font-weight);
    color: var(--card-description-foreground);
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Mionas: Description",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "role",
      "label": "Role",
      "options": [
        { "value": "display-lg", "label": "Display large" },
        { "value": "display-md", "label": "Display medium" },
        { "value": "display-sm", "label": "Display small" },
        { "value": "headline-lg", "label": "Headline large" },
        { "value": "headline-md", "label": "Headline medium" },
        { "value": "headline-sm", "label": "Headline small" },
        { "value": "title-lg", "label": "Title large" },
        { "value": "title-md", "label": "Title medium" },
        { "value": "title-sm", "label": "Title small" },
        { "value": "body-lg", "label": "Body large" },
        { "value": "body-md", "label": "Body medium" },
        { "value": "body-sm", "label": "Body small" },
        { "value": "label-lg", "label": "Label large" },
        { "value": "label-md", "label": "Label medium" },
        { "value": "label-sm", "label": "Label small" },
        { "value": "stamp", "label": "Stamp" }
      ],
      "default": "label-lg",
      "info": "The same text roles as Mionas: Text. Weight and colour stay the card description's."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Mionas: Description",
      "category": "t:categories.product"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
